  "repo_truth": "The first protocol enabling commit is e2cb4e1f7ad3d8f12f651a2b09d7d69bbbd49569. The reviewed ancillary-prefix enabling commit is 86b1413. The smoke terminal handoff/ledger closeout is 7160acd and preserves reviewed product primary 2609bf5. Ordinary validation and both self-tests pass against 77 records, 449 current dispatches, and 77 ledger entries. GitNexus FTS remains unavailable and its staged protocol scans reported no indexed changes; these diagnostics are not represented as GREEN. The protocol repair is not complete until its own handoff/ledger commit lands.",
