    "Review the exact 19-entry converged-corpus subject read-only.",
    "Verify completed handoffs are terminal and non-completed same-parent successors require exact dual-link supersession and identity continuity.",
    "Verify each interim cutoff owns only its exact dispatch/ancillary prefix while the latest terminal smoke record owns all six dispatches.",
    "Verify the four-commit dependency sequence and temporary failure have converged without history rewrites or new smoke dispatches."
  ],
